OL,3,GNEWSAMinister 'most concerned about'
OL,4,Aneurology staffing
OL,5,
OL,6,FJersey's neurology department is the
OL,7,Farea the health minister is "most
OL,8,Fconcerned about" when it comes to the
OL,9,Fhealth service, he has told the BBC.
OL,11,FNeurology is the department that treats
OL,12,Fand supports patients with conditions
OL,13,Fsuch as Huntington's disease,
OL,14,FParkinson's disease, epilepsy and motor
OL,15,Fneurone disease (MND). The department
OL,16,Fhas faced a host of challenges,
OL,17,Fincluding relying on a single
OL,18,Fconsultant who had recently retired.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,445,440,260,160,0,100
