OL,3,GNEWSAMinister 'most concerned about'
OL,4,Aneurology staffing
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe challenges were documented in a
OL,7,FRoyal College of Physicians review
OL,8,Fwhich found the neurology team was
OL,9,Fdedicated but overstretched.
OL,11,FMinister Tom Binet said he and health
OL,12,Fleaders had been "trying desperately to
OL,13,Frecruit" staff.
